            "block_content": "All CSR's (I and II) will be considered universal representatives. If there are other duties which are currently being performed by Customer Service Representatives, but which are not reflected on this list, the Company and the Union agree that those duties will be considered part of the Customer Service Representative classification, with the exception of issues which are currently in dispute or being handled through the grievance procedure.",
