        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For purposes of pay increases, Customer Service Representative I's will be evaluated on lower measures than Customer Service Representatives II. In addition, for purposes of pay increases only, employees in the Customer Service Representative I classification will have a limited evaluation on quality. The substantive portion of the quality evaluation will only be reviewed on certain types of calls (See Below). On calls outside the specified list, employees in the Customer Service Representative I classification will only be evaluated (for purposes of pay increases) on the non-substantive portion of the calls. However, Customer Service Representative I's will be coached on all types of calls.",
